      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happens because UdonEditorManager.PopulateAllPrefabSerializedProgramAssetReferences loads all prefabs and searches UdonBehaviour. Candidate files are gathered by UdonEditorManager.GetAllPrefabAssetPaths. That are actually \"all prefabs\". It is completely wasteful to load pre-existing assets that are not made for Udon or VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
