      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This was improved a while ago. There was a specific step in the process that scanned and serialized udonbehaviour variables. It could take multiple minutes in large scenes. It received multiple optimizations to reduce it down to about 5% of it's previous time.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
